<title>QATAR: TENNIS-QATAR OPEN SECOND ROUND. [CORRECTED 22:32 GMT]</title>
<headline>TENNIS-QATAR OPEN SECOND ROUND. [CORRECTED 22:32 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1997-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results at the $635,000</p>
<p>Qatar Open on Wednesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Magnus Larsson (Sweden) beat Patrik Fredriksson (Sweden) 6-4</p>
<p>7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>Hicham Arazi (Morocco) beat Patrick McEnroe (U.S.) 2-6 7-5 7-5</p>
<p>Tim Henman (Britain) beat Tamy el-Sawy (Egypt) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>5-Magnus Gustafsson (Sweden) beat Dominik Hrbaty (Slovakia) 6-2</p>
<p>2-6 6-4 (corrects final set score from 6-3)</p>
</text>
